Indeed, its one call is at `ContraptionRotationState#asMatrix` accounts for this asymmetrically.
```java
public Matrix3d asMatrix() {
	if (matrix != null)
		return matrix;

	matrix = new Matrix3d().asIdentity();
	if (xRotation != 0)
		matrix.multiply(new Matrix3d().asXRotation(AngleHelper.rad(-xRotation)));
	if (yRotation != 0)
		matrix.multiply(new Matrix3d().asYRotation(AngleHelper.rad(yRotation)));
	if (zRotation != 0)
		matrix.multiply(new Matrix3d().asZRotation(AngleHelper.rad(-zRotation)));
	return matrix;
}
```

This pull request fixes the method and thus restores the symmetry.

###### Summary

These changes convert the experimental call stacks and exceptions features into supported features in the 8.0 version:
- Removed experimental feature flags for call stacks and exceptions
- Add `CallStacks` and `Exceptions` configuration sections under the `InProcessFeatures` configuration section; each new section has an `Enabled` property.
- Tests have been updated to use the new configuration elements to verify the feature state.

Details of enabling features:
- If `InProcessFeatures:Enabled` is set to true, both of these features are enabled automatically.
- If `InProcessFeatures:Enabled` is set to false, both are disabled regardless of the settings for each feature.
- If `InProcessFeatures:<Feature>:Enabled` is set to true (but `InProcessFeatures:Enabled` is unconfigured or true), then the individual feature is enabled. **Note this is a new behavior introduced in this PR to simplify configuration of in-process features so users can opt-into individual features rather than taking the whole default set.**
- If `InProcessFeatures:<Feature>:Enabled` is set to false, then the individual feature is disabled.

Example JSON configuration that enables the call stacks feature only with minimal configuration:
```
{
  "InProcessFeatures": {
    "CallStacks": {
      "Enabled": true
    }
  }
}
```

Example JSON configuration that enables all in-process features but opts out of call stack feature:
```
{
  "InProcessFeatures": {
    "Enabled": true
    "CallStacks": {
      "Enabled": false
    }
  }
}
```

